+rank 1 replays; they also go to the NVMe tier like any entry), and every other entry is under the store's LRU as
+before. In batch mode
+(``batch.Batcher._plan``) a session admitted while another one is still prefilling toward such a mark of a prompt it
+shares waits for it (GLM53_TF_PREFIX_SHARE_WAIT, on), then resumes at it instead of prefilling the same prefix side
+by side. A mark is a snapshot the prefill takes where the engine may take one (the exact chunk cut there, fast marks
+on the 64-grid): no new arithmetic, resumed == fresh as for every mark.
